  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#948;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#948;</mi><mn>2021</mn></msup></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Akxs7",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
